nd="33.460">ぎ</span><span begin="33.460" end="34.130">す</span><span begin="34.130" end="34.385">ぎ</span><span begin="34.385" end="34.506">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">週</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="34.506" end="35.139">しゅう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">末</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="35.139" end="35.350">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="35.350" end="35.663">つ</span></span></span><span begin="35.663" end="35.818">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是因为玩闹过头的周末</span></p><p begin="35.818" end="40.423" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.818" end="36.134">シ</span><span begin="36.134" end="36.378">ワ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">寄</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="36.378" end="36.621">よ</span></span></span><span begin="36.621" end="37.064">せ</span><span begin="37.400" end="37.700">な</span><span begin="37.700" end="38.181">ら</span><span begin="38.181" end="38.373">ば</span><span begin="38.373" end="38.667">ま</span><span begin="38.667" end="38.956">だ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">良</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="38.956" end="39.322">い</span></span></span><span begin="39.322" end="39.749">い</span><span begin="39.749" end="39.985">の</span><span begin="39.985" end="40.423">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而受到影响的话那还算好</span></p><p begin="40.698" end="43.836" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">変</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="40.698" end="40.938">か</span></span></span><span begin="40.938" end="41.218">わ</span><span begin="41.218" end="41.460">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">映</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="41.460" end="41.736">ば</span></span></span><span begin="41.736" end="42.006">え</span><span begin="42.006" end="42.308">ない</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">外</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="42.497" end="42.731">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="42.731" end="42.946">ず</span></span></span><span begin="42.946" end="43.224">れ</span><span begin="43.224" end="43.525">な</span><span begin="43.525" end="43.836">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但束缚在我心头的那道枷锁</span></p><p begin="44.028" end="48.586" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">心</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="44.028" end="44.272">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="44.272" end="44.534">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="44.534" end="44.753">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="44.753" end="44.977">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">付</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="44.977" end="45.271">つ</span></span></span><span begin="45.271" end="45.502">い</span><span begin="45.502" end="45.783">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">足</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="45.783" end="45.932">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="45.932" end="46.526">し</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">枷</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="46.526" end="46.963">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="46.963" end="48.586">せ</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却始终一如既往 无法解除</span></p><p begin="48.807" end="53.219" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">先</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="48.807" end="49.072">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="49.072" end="49.370">き</span></span></span><span begin="49.370" end="49.616">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="49.616" end="49.862">み</span></span></span><span begin="49.862" end="50.291">え</span><span begin="50.291" end="50.660">な</span><span begin="50.660" end="50.884">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夜</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="50.884" end="51.417">よ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="51.417" end="51.675">る</span></span></span><span begin="51.675" end="51.895">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">帰</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="51.895" end="52.204">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="52.204" end="52.450">え</span></span></span><span begin="52.450" end="52.688">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">道</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="52.688" end="52.910">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="52.910" end="53.219">ち</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在看不见前方的夜间的归途中</span></p><p begin="53.437" end="56.810" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.437" end="53.447">「</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">明</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="53.447" end="53.538">あ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="53.538" end="53.986">す</span></span></span><span begin="53.986" end="54.422">なん</span><span begin="54.422" end="54.687">て</span><span begin="54.687" end="54.949">な</span><span begin="54.949" end="55.237">きゃ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">良</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="55.237" end="55.762">い</span></span></span><span begin="55.762" end="55.990">い</span><span begin="55.990" end="56.239">の</span><span begin="56.239" end="56.772">に</span><span begin="56.772" end="56.810">」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心想着“要是没有明天就好了”</span></p><p begin="57.242" end="59.744" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="57.242" end="57.504">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="57.504" end="57.743">ま</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="57.743" end="58.060">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="58.060" end="58.247">ん</span></span></span><span begin="58.247" end="58.543">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="58.543" end="58.942">い</span></span></span><span begin="58.942" end="59.730">った</span><span begin="59.730" end="59.744">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">刚刚说了什么？</span></p><p begin="1:00.037" end="1:04.069" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.037" end="1:00.326">あ</span><span begin="1:00.326" end="1:00.532">ぁ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">確</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:00.532" end="1:00.668">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:00.668" end="1:01.062">し</span></span></span><span begin="1:01.062" end="1:01.566">か</span><span begin="1:01.566" end="1:01.827">め</span><span begin="1:01.827" end="1:02.066">な</span><span begin="1:02.066" end="1:02.327">きゃ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">良</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:02.327" end="1:02.589">よ</span></span></span><span begin="1:02.589" end="1:02.993">か</span><span begin="1:02.993" end="1:04.069">った</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 要是没再确认一遍就好了</span></p><p begin="1:04.173" end="1:08.937" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.173" end="1:04.650">そ</span><span begin="1:04.650" end="1:05.130">ん</span><span begin="1:05.130" end="1:05.593">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">時</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:05.593" end="1:05.877">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:05.877" end="1:06.040">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">震</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:06.040" end="1:06.344">ふ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:06.344" end="1:06.594">る</span></span></span><span begin="1:06.594" end="1:06.884">え</span><span begin="1:06.884" end="1:07.169">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">ポ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:07.169" end="1:07.408">po</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">ケ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:07.408" end="1:08.061">ck</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">ット</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:08.061" end="1:08.278">et</span></span></span><span begin="1:08.278" end="1:08.477">か</span><span begin="1:08.477" end="1:08.937">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这时从震动的口袋里取出的</span></p><p begin="1:09.192" end="1:12.548" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:09.192" end="1:09.480">み</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">慣</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:09.480" end="1:10.163">な</span></span></span><span begin="1:10.163" end="1:10.323">れ</span><span begin="1:10.323" end="1:10.489">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">文</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:10.489" end="1:11.133">も</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">字</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:11.133" end="1:11.477">じ</span></span></span><span begin="1:11.477" end="1:11.619">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">光</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:11.619" end="1:11.964">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:11.964" end="1:12.301">か</span></span></span><span begin="1:12.301" end="1:12.548">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">手机屏幕上亮起了熟悉的文字</span></p><p begin="1:12.716" end="1:16.571" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.716" end="1:13.037">そ</span><span begin="1:13.037" end="1:13.206">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">通</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.206" end="1:13.486">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.486" end="1:13.717">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">知</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.717" end="1:13.985">ち</span></span></span><span begin="1:13.985" end="1:14.262">ひ</span><span begin="1:14.262" end="1:14.750">と</span><span begin="1:14.750" end="1:15.038">つ</span><span begin="1:15.038" end="1:15.145">で</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">全</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:15.145" end="1:15.800">す</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:15.800" end="1:16.044">べ</span></span></span><span begin="1:16.044" end="1:16.307">て</span><span begin="1:16.307" end="1:16.571">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的讯息来得时机恰好</span></p><p begin="1:16.750" end="1:21.224" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">救</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:16.750" end="1:17.065">す</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:17.065" end="1:17.349">く</span></span></span><span begin="1:17.349" end="1:17.582">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">得</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:17.582" end="1:17.877">う</span></span></span><span begin="1:17.877" end="1:18.093">る</span><span begin="1:18.093" end="1:18.349">あ</span><span begin="1:18.349" end="1:18.613">な</span><span begin="1:18.613" end="1:18.887">た</span><span begin="1:18.887" end="1:19.102">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">間</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:19.102" end="1:19.386">ま</span></span></span><span begin="1:19.386" end="1:19.596">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">良</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:19.596" end="1:20.237">よ</span></span></span><span begin="1:20.237" end="1:20.650">さ</span><span begin="1:20.650" end="1:21.224">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我的一切都得到救赎</span></p><p begin="1:21.477" end="1:25.447" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.477" end="1:21.848">し</span><span begin="1:21.848" end="1:22.153">ん</span><span begin="1:22.153" end="1:22.436">ど</span><span begin="1:22.436" end="1:22.698">い</span><span begin="1:22.698" end="1:23.136">なぁ</span><span begin="1:23.136" end="1:23.414">な</span><span begin="1:23.414" end="1:23.670">ん</span><span begin="1:23.670" end="1:23.956">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">思</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:23.956" end="1:24.221">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:24.221" end="1:24.597">も</span></span></span><span begin="1:24.597" end="1:24.904">って</span><span begin="1:24.904" end="1:25.203">ん</span><span begin="1:25.203" end="1:25.447">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就仿佛我的疲惫厌倦和辛苦</span></p><p begin="1:25.447" end="1:29.124" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">バ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:25.447" end="1:25.965">Ba</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">レ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:25.965" end="1:26.229">re</span></span></span><span begin="1:26.229" end="1:26.474">て</span><span begin="1:26.474" end="1:26.743">る</span><span begin="1:26.743" end="1:26.965">み</span><span begin="1:26.965" end="1:27.261">た</span><span begin="1:27.261" end="1:27.621">い</span><span begin="1:27.621" end="1:29.124">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都被你看穿了一般</span></p><p begin="1:29.719" end="1:32.879" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">ノ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:29.719" end="1:30.048">No</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">ル</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:30.048" end="1:30.296">r</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">マ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:30.296" end="1:30.552">mal</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">以</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:30.552" end="1:31.023">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">下</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:31.023" end="1:31.285">か</span></span></span><span begin="1:31.285" end="1:31.563">か</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">以</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:31.563" end="1:32.038">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">上</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:32.038" end="1:32.362">じょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:32.362" end="1:32.574">う</span></span></span><span begin="1:32.574" end="1:32.879">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天相比往常更好还是更坏</span></p><p begin="1:33.110" end="1:37.491" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:33.110" end="1:33.326">に</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:33.326" end="1:33.576">ち</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">常</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:33.576" end="1:34.132">じょう</span></span></span><span begin="1:34.132" end="1:34.351">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:34.351" end="1:34.637">きょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:34.637" end="1:35.124">う</span></span></span><span begin="1:35.124" end="1:35.324">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">計</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:35.324" end="1:35.609">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:35.609" end="1:36.158">か</span></span></span><span begin="1:36.158" end="1:36.347">ら</span><span begin="1:36.347" end="1:36.712">れ</span><span begin="1:36.712" end="1:37.491">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">日常依然逃不过被衡量</span></p><p begin="1:37.814" end="1:41.013" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">スー</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:37.814" end="1:38.377">Su</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">ツ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:38.377" end="1:38.698">its</span></span></span><span begin="1:38.698" end="1:39.176">で</span><span begin="1:39.176" end="1:39.329">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">ス</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:39.329" end="1:39.694">s</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">ウェ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:39.694" end="1:40.158">wea</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">ット</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:40.158" end="1:40.481">ter</span></span></span><span begin="1:40.481" end="1:40.653">で</span><span begin="1:40.653" end="1:41.013">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿西装也好运动卫衣也好</span></p><p begin="1:41.143" end="1:45.598" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.143" end="1:41.506">そ</span><span begin="1:41.506" end="1:41.752">れ</span><span begin="1:41.752" end="1:42.025">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">同</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:42.025" end="1:42.279">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:42.279" end="1:42.463">な</span></span></span><span begin="1:42.463" end="1:42.820">じ</span><span begin="1:42.820" end="1:43.244">み</span><span begin="1:43.244" end="1:43.562">た</span><span begin="1:43.562" end="1:43.933">い</span><span begin="1:43.933" end="1:45.598">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似乎并没有什么区别</span></p><p begin="1:46.030" end="1:49.178" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">変</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:46.030" end="1:46.327">か</span></span></span><span begin="1:46.327" end="1:46.590">わ</span><span begin="1:46.590" end="1:46.783">り</span><span begin="1:46.783" end="1:47.336">な</span><span begin="1:47.336" end="1:47.573">い</span><span begin="1:47.573" end="1:47.833">か</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">元</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:47.833" end="1:48.325">げ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:48.325" end="1:48.581">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">気</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:48.581" end="1:48.861">き</span></span></span><span begin="1:48.861" end="1:49.178">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一如既往吗 别来无恙吗</span></p><p begin="1:49.378" end="1:53.748" i