end="1:56.942">で</span><span begin="1:56.942" end="1:57.272">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论日子是好是坏</span></p><p begin="1:57.424" end="2:02.289" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:57.424" end="1:57.670">そ</span><span begin="1:57.670" end="1:58.011">れ</span><span begin="1:58.011" end="1:58.260">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">同</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:58.260" end="1:58.539">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:58.539" end="1:58.729">な</span></span></span><span begin="1:58.729" end="1:59.061">じ</span><span begin="1:59.061" end="1:59.520">み</span><span begin="1:59.520" end="1:59.848">た</span><span begin="1:59.848" end="2:00.083">い</span><span begin="2:00.083" end="2:02.289">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似乎也并没有区别</span></p><p begin="2:18.532" end="2:24.116" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">凹</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.532" end="2:18.839">へ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.839" end="2:19.092">こ</span></span></span><span begin="2:19.092" end="2:19.232">み</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">過</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:19.232" end="2:19.880">す</span></span></span><span begin="2:19.880" end="2:20.117">ぎ</span><span begin="2:20.117" end="2:20.376">た</span><span begin="2:20.376" end="2:20.670">ど</span><span begin="2:20.670" end="2:20.876">ん</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">底</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:20.876" end="2:21.115">ぞ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:21.115" end="2:21.404">こ</span></span></span><span begin="2:21.404" end="2:21.540">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">最</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:21.540" end="2:21.954">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:21.954" end="2:22.102">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">果</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.102" end="2:22.438">は</span></span></span><span begin="2:22.438" end="2:22.910">て</span><span begin="2:23.156" end="2:23.450">よ</span><span begin="2:23.450" end="2:23.916">り</span><span begin="2:23.916" end="2:24.116">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明还没有糟糕到</span></p><p begin="2:24.116" end="2:26.204" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:24.116" end="2:24.447">ま</span><span begin="2:24.447" end="2:24.676">だ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">良</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:24.676" end="2:25.011">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:25.011" end="2:25.482">い</span><span begin="2:25.482" end="2:25.702">の</span><span begin="2:25.702" end="2:26.204">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">灰心失望 跌落深渊之底的地步</span></p><p begin="2:26.401" end="2:29.587" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:26.401" end="2:26.764">そ</span><span begin="2:26.764" end="2:27.012">う</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">思</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:27.012" end="2:27.282">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:27.282" end="2:27.501">も</span></span></span><span begin="2:27.501" end="2:27.732">え</span><span begin="2:27.732" end="2:27.919">な</span><span begin="2:27.919" end="2:28.100">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">割</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:28.287" end="2:28.514">わ</span></span></span><span begin="2:28.514" end="2:28.741">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">切</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:28.741" end="2:29.053">き</span></span></span><span begin="2:29.053" end="2:29.219">れ</span><span begin="2:29.219" end="2:29.405">な</span><span begin="2:29.405" end="2:29.587">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却无法如此认为 无法坦然释怀</span></p><p begin="2:29.803" end="2:34.504" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">心</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:29.803" end="2:30.009">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:30.009" end="2:30.329">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:30.329" end="2:30.536">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="2:30.536" end="2:30.767">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:30.767" end="2:31.094">で</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">来</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:31.094" end="2:31.292">き</span></span></span><span begin="2:31.292" end="2:31.583">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">肌</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:31.583" end="2:31.838">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:31.838" end="2:32.327">だ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">荒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:32.327" end="2:32.872">あ</span></span></span><span begin="2:32.872" end="2:34.504">れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">使得内心也开始敏感慌乱起来</span></p><p begin="2:34.850" end="2:39.117" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">塗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:34.850" end="2:35.135">ぬ</span></span></span><span begin="2:35.135" end="2:35.356">り</span><span begin="2:35.356" end="2:35.611">た</span><span begin="2:35.611" end="2:36.055">く</span><span begin="2:36.055" end="2:36.368">った</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">細</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:36.368" end="2:36.565">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:36.565" end="2:37.145">ま</span></span></span><span begin="2:37.145" end="2:37.402">や</span><span begin="2:37.402" end="2:37.701">か</span><span begin="2:37.701" end="2:37.825">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">幸</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:37.825" end="2:38.222">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:38.222" end="2:38.477">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:38.477" end="2:38.641">わ</span></span></span><span begin="2:38.641" end="2:39.117">せ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">随意在生活中添加细微的幸福</span></p><p begin="2:39.437" end="2:41.936" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:39.437" end="2:39.701">ど</span><span begin="2:39.701" end="2:40.180">れ</span><span begin="2:40.180" end="2:40.419">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">効</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:40.419" end="2:40.699">き</span></span></span><span begin="2:40.699" end="2:40.942">か</span><span begin="2:40.942" end="2:41.372">な</span><span begin="2:41.372" end="2:41.483">く</span><span begin="2:41.483" end="2:41.936">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却一个也不曾起效</span></p><p begin="2:41.936" end="2:45.854" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">潰</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:41.936" end="2:42.249">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:42.249" end="2:42.363">ぶ</span></span></span><span begin="2:42.363" end="2:42.760">せ</span><span begin="2:42.760" end="2:42.905">も</span><span begin="2:42.905" end="2:43.247">せ</span><span begin="2:43.247" end="2:43.456">ず</span><span begin="2:43.456" end="2:43.820">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">赤</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:44.028" end="2:44.266">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:44.266" end="2:44.530">か</span></span></span><span begin="2:44.530" end="2:44.789">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:44.789" end="2:45.019">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:45.019" end="2:45.350">お</span></span></span><span begin="2:45.350" end="2:45.506">き</span><span begin="2:45.506" end="2:45.854">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不曾溃散 那些赤红而又庞大的存在</span></p><p begin="2:46.017" end="2:49.790" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">時</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:46.017" end="2:46.278">じ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">間</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:46.278" end="2:46.593">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:46.593" end="2:46.788">ん</span></span></span><span begin="2:46.788" end="2:47.066">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">共</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:47.066" end="2:47.341">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:47.341" end="2:47.602">も</span></span></span><span begin="2:47.602" end="2:47.770">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">酷</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:47.770" end="2:48.109">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:48.109" end="2:48.350">ど</span></span></span><span begin="2:48.350" end="2:48.632">く</span><span begin="2:48.632" end="2:49.037">な</span><span begin="2:49.037" end="2:49.652">って</span><span begin="2:49.652" end="2:49.790">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">随着时间的流逝反而愈发恶化</span></p><p begin="2:50.056" end="2:54.743" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">解</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:50.056" end="2:50.407">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:50.407" end="2:50.850">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">決</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:50.850" end="2:51.226">け</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:51.226" end="2:51.426">つ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">策</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:51.426" end="2:51.629">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:51.629" end="2:51.854">く</span></span></span><span begin="2:51.854" end="2:52.122">は</span><span begin="2:52.122" end="2:52.386">い</span><span begin="2:52.386" end="2:52.618">く</span><span begin="2:52.618" end="2:52.897">つ</span><span begin="2:52.897" end="2:53.174">か</span><span begin="2:53.174" end="2:53.870">あ</span><span begin="2:53.870" end="2:54.048">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">事</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:54.048" end="2:54.235">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:54.235" end="2:54.743">と</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管知道还有好几种解决方法</span></p><p begin="2:54.969" end="2:58.317" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">分</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:54.969" end="2:55.185">わ</span></span></span><span begin="2:55.185" end="2:55.893">か</span><span begin="2:55.893" end="2:56.063">って</span><span begin="2:56.063" end="2:56.227">て</span><span begin="2:56.227" end="2:56.733">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">踏</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:56.936" end="2:57.164">ふ</span></span></span><span begin="2:57.164" end="2:57.504">み</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:57.504" end="2:57.615">だ</span></span></span><span begin="2:57.615" end="2:58.038">せ</span><span begin="2:58.038" end="2:58.178">な</span><span begin="2:58.178" end="2:58.317">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍旧无法迈出第一步</span></p><p begin="2:58.498" end="3:02.359" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">ホ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:58.498" end="2:58.770">Ho</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">メ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:58.770" end="2:58.995">me</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">オ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:58.995" end="2:59.189">o</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">ス</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:59.189" end="2:59.530">s</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">タ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:59.530" end="2:59.698">ta</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">シ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:59.698" end="2:59.950">si</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">ス</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:59.950" end="3:00.558">s</span></span></span><span begin="3:00.558" end="3:00.808">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">7</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:00.808" end="3:01.061">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:01.061" end="3:01.562">な</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">文</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:01.562" end="3:01.779">も</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">字</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:01.779" end="3:02.074">じ</span></span></span><span begin="3:02.074" end="3:02.359">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“维持稳定的心态”这7个字</span></p><p begin="3:02.584" end="3:07.298" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">容</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:02.584" end="3:02.827">た</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">易</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:02.827" end="3:02.983">や</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:02.983" end="3:03.326">す</span></span></span><span begin="3:03.326" end="3:03.557">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">躓</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:03.557" end="3:03.822">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:03.822" end="3:04.034">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:04.034" end="3:04.374">ず</span></span></span><span begin="3:04.374" end="3:04.607">い</span><span begin="3:04.607" end="3:04.892">て</span><span begin="3:04.892" end="3:05.093">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">心</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:05.093" end="3:05.346">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:05.346" end="3:06.148">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:06.148" end="3:06.353">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="3:06.353" end="3:06.860">じゃ</span><span begin="3:06.860" end="3:07.140">も</span><span begin="3:07.140" end="3:07.298">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就能轻易让我的心倍感挫败</span></p><p begin="3:07.298" end="3:11.218" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:07.298" end="3:07.905">しん</span><span begin="3:07.905" end="3:08.186">ど</span><span begin="3:08.186" end="3:08.460">い</span><span begin="3:08.460" end="3:08.736">なぁ</span><span begin="3:08.923" end="3:09.246">な</span><span begin="3:09.246" end="3:09.453">ん</span><span begin="3:09.453" end="3:09.705">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">嘆</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:09.705" end="3:09.910">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:09.910" end="3:10.240">げ</span></span></span><span begin="3:10.240" end="3:10.453">い</span><span begin="3:10.453" end="3:10.937">た</span><span begin="3:10.937" end="3:11.218">って</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而感叹自身的辛苦与疲惫</span></p><p begin="3:11.218" end="3:15.062" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">迷</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:11.218" end="3:11.726">め</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:11.726" end="3:11.975">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">惑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:11.975" end="3:12.218">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:12.218" end="3:12.531">く</span></span></span><span begin="3:12.531" end="3:12.735">み</span><span begin="3:12.735" end="3:13.050">た</span><span begin="3:13.050" end="3:13.402">い</span><span begin="3:13.402" end="3:15.062">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似乎只会给人添麻烦</span></p><p begin="3:15.566" end="3:18.648" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:15.566" end="3:15.842">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:15.842" end="3:16.050">に</span></span></span><span begin="3:16.050" end="3:16.316">を</span><span begin="3:16.316" end="3:16.806">ど</span><span begin="3:16.806" end="3:16.988">う</span><span begin="3:16.988" end="3:17.275">し</span><span begin="3:17.275" end="3:17.843">た</span><span begin="3:17.843" end="3:18.093">い</span><span begin="3:18.093" end="3:18.321">の</span><span begin="3:18.321" end="3:18.648">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仔细考量有关自己的事</span></p><p begin="3:18.820" end="3:23.130" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">自</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:18.820" end="3:19.108">じ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">分</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:19.108" end="3:19.375">ぶ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:19.375" end="3:19.808">ん</span></span></span><span begin="3:19.808" end="3:20.102">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">事</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:20.102" end="3:20.373">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:20.373" end="3:20.918">と</span></span></span><span begin="3:20.918" end="3:21.179">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">推</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:21.179" end="3:21.267">お</span></span></span><span begin="3:21.267" end="3:21.871">し</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">測</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:21.871" end="3:22.139">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:22.139" end="3:22.463">か</span></span></span><span begin="3:22.463" end="3:23.130">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟想做什么 又想怎么做</span></p><p begin="3:23.377" end="3:26.789" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">辛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:23.377" end="3:23.629">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:23.629" end="3:23.896">ら</span></span></span><span begin="3:23.896" end="3:24.188">い</span><span begin="3:24.188" end="3:24.451">と</span><span begin="3:24.451" end="3:24.764">か</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">辞</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:24.949" end="3:25.202">や</span></span></span><span begin="3:25.202" end="3:25.439">め</span><span begin="3:25.439" end="3:25.972">た</span><span begin="3:25.972" end="3:26.220">い</span><span begin="3:26.220" end="3:26.487">と</span><span begin="3:26.487" end="3:26.789">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">辛苦的感觉和放弃的想法</span></p><p begin="3:26.911" end="3:31.358" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:26.911" end="3:27.242">そ</span><span begin="3:27.242" end="3:27.495">れ</span><span begin="3:27.495" end="3:27.683">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:27.683" end="3:28.029">ひ</span></span></span><span begin="3:28.029" end="3:28.219">に</span><span begin="3:28.219" end="3:28.553">よ</span><span begin="3:28.553" end="3:28.739">る</span><span begin="3:28.739" end="3:29.018">み</span><span begin="3:29.018" end="3:29.333">た</span><span begin="3:29.333" end="3:29.678">い</span><span begin="3:29.678" end="3:31.358">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好像也不是每天都会有</span></p><p begin="3:31.786" end="3:34.938" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:31.786" end="3:31.796">「</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:31.796" end="3:32.114">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:32.114" end="3:32.333">ん</span></span></span><span begin="3:32.333" end="3:32.605">で</span><span begin="3:32.605" end="3:32.899">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">打</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:33.115" end="3:33.313">う</span></span></span><span begin="3:33.313" end="3:33.550">ち</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">明</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:33.550" end="3:34.069">あ</span></span></span><span begin="3:34.069" end="3:34.359">け</span><span begin="3:34.359" end="3:34.611">て</span><span begin="3:34.611" end="3:34.925">と</span><span begin="3:34.925" end="3:34.938">」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“不管什么事都和我说说吧”</span></p><p begin="3:35.110" end="3:39.427" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:35.110" end="3:35.363">い</span></span></span><span begin="3:35.363" end="3:35.661">わ</span><span begin="3:35.661" end="3:36.047">れ</span><span begin="3:36.047" end="3:36.147">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">度</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:36.147" end="3:36.379">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:36.379" end="3:36.646">び</span></span></span><span begin="3:36.646" end="3:37.166">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:37.166" end="3:37.384">い</span></span></span><span begin="3:37.384" end="3:37.575">え</span><span begin="3:37.669" end="3:38.160">な</span><span begin="3:38.160" end="3:38.406">く</span><span begin="3:38.406" end="3:38.746">な</span><span begin="3:38.746" end="3:39.427">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每当有人这么对我说 我反而愈加说不出口</span></p><p begin="3:39.697" end="3:43.063" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:39.697" end="3:39.907">ご</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">厚</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:39.907" end="3:40.144">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:40.144" end="3:40.456">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">意</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:40.456" end="3:40.734">い</span></span></span><span begin="3:40.734" end="3:41.036">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">甘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:41.232" end="3:41.469">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:41.469" end="3:41.677">ま</span></span></span><span begin="3:41.677" end="3:42.269">え</span><span begin="3:42.269" end="3:42.418">る</span><span begin="3:42.418" end="3:42.768">の</span><span begin="3:42.768" end="3:43.063">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看来享受他人的好意</span></p><p begin="3:43.246" end="3:46.616" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">割</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:43.246" end="3:43.567">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:43.567" end="3:43.755">り</span></span></span><span begin="3:43.755" end="3:44.006">と</span><span begin="3:44.006" end="3:44.247">キ</span><span begin="3:44.247" end="3:44.492">ツ</span><span begin="3:44.492" end="3:44.823">い</span><span begin="3:44.823" end="3:45.268">み</span><span begin="3:45.268" end="3:45.587">た</span><span begin="3:45.587" end="3:45.845">い</span><span begin="3:45.845" end="3:46.616">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也不是一件容易的事</span></p><p begin="3:46.831" end="3:51.630" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">別</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:46.831" end="3:46.996">べ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:46.996" end="3:47.590">つ</span></span></span><span begin="3:47.590" end="3:48.031">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:48.031" end="3:48.545">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:48.545" end="3:48.749">い</span></span></span><span begin="3:48.749" end="3:48.962">し</span><span begin="3:48.962" end="3:49.103">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">事</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:49.103" end="3:49.591">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:49.591" end="3:50.069">と</span></span></span><span begin="3:50.069" end="3:50.914">な</span><span begin="3:50.914" end="3:51.123">い</span><span begin="3:51.123" end="3:51.630">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这没有什么大不了的</span></p><p begin="3:51.885" end="3:55.787" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">話</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:51.885" end="3:52.134">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:52.134" end="3:52.723">な</span></span></span><span begin="3:52.723" end="3:52.910">す</span><span begin="3:52.910" end="3:53.153">だ</span><span begin="3:53.153" end="3:53.450">け</span><span begin="3:53.450" end="3:53.648">で</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">十</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:53.648" end="3:53.971">じゅ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:53.971" end="3:54.183">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">分</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:54.183" end="3:54.794">ぶ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:54.794" end="3:54.976">ん</span></span></span><span begin="3:54.976" end="3:55.219">だ</span><span begin="3:55.219" end="3:55.787">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要说出来就足够了</span></p><p begin="3:56.210" end="3:59.581" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">打</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:56.210" end="3:56.724">う</span></span></span><span begin="3:56.724" end="3:57.036">た</span><span begin="3:57.036" end="3:57.270">れ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">弱</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:57.270" end="3:57.765">よ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:57.765" end="3:58.043">わ</span></span></span><span begin="3:58.043" end="3:58.273">い</span><span begin="3:58.273" end="3:58.667">く</span><span begin="3:58.667" end="3:58.970">せ</span><span begin="3:58.970" end="3:59.287">し</span><span begin="3:59.287" end="3:59.581">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明自己脆弱得不堪一击</span></p><p begin="3:59.825" end="4:11.251" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:59.825" end="4:00.301">あ</span><span begin="4:00.301" end="4:00.782">な</span><span begin="4:00.782" end="4:01.085">た</span><span begin="4:01.085" end="4:01.312">に</span><span begin="4:01.312" end="4:01.846">ま</span><span begin="4:01.846" end="4:02.102">だ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">良</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:02.102" end="4:02.393">い</span></span></span><span begin="4:02.393" end="4:02.820">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">顔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:02.820" end="4:03.068">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:03.068" end="4:03.350">お</span></span></span><span begin="4:03.350" end="4:03.722">を</span><span begin="4:03.722" end="4:03.860">し</span><span begin="4:03.860" end="4:04.145">て</span><span begin="4:04.145" end="4:04.372">い</span><span begin="4:04.372" end="4:11.251">たい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却还是想要对你露出最友善的表情</span></p><p begin="4:20.651" end="4:23.735" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">ノ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:20.651" end="4:20.909">No</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">ル</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:20.909" end="4:21.093">r</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">マ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:21.093" end="4:21.389">mal</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">以</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:21.389" end="4:21.873">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">下</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:21.873" end="4:22.133">か</span></span></span><span begin="4:22.133" end="4:22.404">か</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">以</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:22.404" end="4:22.879">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">上</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:22.879" end="4:23.215">じょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:23.215" end="4:23.424">う</span></span></span><span begin="4:23.424" end="4:23.735">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天相比往常更好还是更坏</span></p><p begin="4:23.953" end="4:28.332" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:23.953" end="4:24.173">に</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:24.173" end="4:24.415">ち</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">常</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:24.415" end="4:24.831">じょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:24.831" end="4:24.973">う</span></span></span><span begin="4:24.973" end="4:25.190">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:25.190" end="4:25.480">きょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:25.480" end="4:25.970">う</span></span></span><span begin="4:25.970" end="4:26.177">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">計</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:26.177" end="4:26.448">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:26.448" end="4:27.009">か</span></span></span><span begin="4:27.009" end="4:27.189">ら</span><span begin="4:27.189" end="4:27.565">れ</span><span begin="4:27.565" end="4:28.332">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">日常依然逃不过被衡量</span></p><p begin="4:28.582" end="4:31.859" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">スー</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:28.582" end="4:29.235">Su</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">ツ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:29.235" end="4:29.547">its</span></span></span><span begin="4:29.547" end="4:30.044">で</span><span begin="4:30.044" end="4:30.196">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">ス</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:30.196" end="4:30.537">s</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">ウェ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:30.537" end="4:30.988">wea</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">ット</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:30.988" end="4:31.344">ter</span></span></span><span begin="4:31.344" end="4:31.526">で</span><span begin="4:31.526" end="4:31.859">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿西装也好运动卫衣也好</span></p><p begin="4:31.981" end="4:36.511" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:31.981" end="4:32.366">そ</span><span begin="4:32.366" end="4:32.617">れ</span><span begin="4:32.617" end="4:32.887">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">同</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:32.887" end="4:33.109">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:33.109" end="4:33.309">な</span></span></span><span begin="4:33.309" end="4:33.637">じ</span><span begin="4:33.637" end="4:34.105">み</span><span begin="4:34.105" end="4:34.420">た</span><span begin="4:34.420" end="4:34.759">い</span><span begin="4:34.759" end="4:36.511">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似乎并没有什么区别</span></p><p begin="4:36.852" end="4:39.978" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">変</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:36.852" end="4:37.142">か</span></span></span><span begin="4:37.142" end="4:37.419">わ</span><span begin="4:37.419" end="4:37.577">り</span><span begin="4:37.577" end="4:38.181">な</span><span begin="4:38.181" end="4:38.418">い</span><span begin="4:38.418" end="4:38.686">か</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">元</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:38.686" end="4:39.212">げ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:39.212" end="4:39.415">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">気</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:39.415" end="4:39.699">き</span></span></span><span begin="4:39.699" end="4:39.978">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一如既往吗 别来无恙吗</span></p><p begin="4:40.194" end="4:44.588" itunes:key="L54" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:40.194" end="4:40.490">あ</span><span begin="4:40.490" end="4:40.706">な</span><span begin="4:40.706" end="4:41.229">た</span><span begin="4:41.229" end="4:41.467">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:41.467" end="4:41.760">きょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:41.760" end="4:42.234">う </span></span></span><span begin="4:42.234" end="4:42.480">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">気</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:42.480" end="4:42.795">き</span></span></span><span begin="4:42.795" end="4:43.255">に</span><span begin="4:43.255" end="4:43.518">か</span><span begin="4:43.518" end="4:43.837">け</span><span begin="4:43.837" end="4:44.588">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天你依然心有所系</span></p><p begin="4:45.014" end="4:48.153" itunes:key="L55" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">良</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:45.014" end="4:45.252">い</span></span></span><span begin="4:45.252" end="4:45.491">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:45.491" end="4:45.775">ひ</span></span></span><span begin="4:45.775" end="4:46.307">で</span><span begin="4:46.307" end="4:46.609">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">悪</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:46.609" end="4:46.864">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:46.864" end="4:47.125">る</span></span></span><span begin="4:47.125" end="4:47.276">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:47.276" end="4:47.624">ひ</span></span></span><span begin="4:47.624" end="4:47.770">で</span><span begin="4:47.770" end="4:48.153">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论日子是好是坏</span></p><p begin="4:48.267" end="4:52.712" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:48.267" end="4:48.575">そ</span><span begin="4:48.575" end="4:48.859">れ</span><span begin="4:48.859" end="4:49.163">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">同</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:49.163" end="4:49.369">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:49.369" end="4:49.579">な</span></span></span><span begin="4:49.579" end="4:49.910">じ</span><span begin="4:49.910" end="4:50.356">み</span><span begin="4:50.356" end="4:50.671">た</span><span begin="4:50.671" end="4:50.934">い</span><span begin="4:50.934" end="4:52.712">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似乎也并没有区别</span></p><p begin="4:53.105" end="4:56.264" itunes:key="L57" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">変</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:53.105" end="4:53.465">か</span></span></span><span begin="4:53.465" end="4:53.729">わ</span><span begin="4:53.729" end="4:53.880">ら</span><span begin="4:53.880" end="4:54.469">な</span><span begin="4:54.469" end="4:54.657">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">人</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:54.657" end="4:54.945">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:54.945" end="4:55.409">と</span></span></span><span begin="4:55.409" end="4:55.658">た</span><span begin="4:55.658" end="4:56.005">ち</span><span begin="4:56.005" end="4:56.264">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是那不变的一群人</span></p><p begin="4:56.471" end="5:00.765" itunes:key="L58" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">悩</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:56.471" end="4:56.699">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:56.699" end="4:56.931">や</span></span></span><span begin="4:56.931" end="4:57.405">ま</span><span begin="4:57.405" end="4:57.814">さ</span><span begin="4:57.814" end="4:58.018">れ</span><span begin="4:58.018" end="4:58.560">て</span><span begin="4:58.560" end="4:58.779">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">癒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:58.779" end="4:59.028">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:59.028" end="4:59.404">や</span></span></span><span begin="4:59.404" end="4:59.748">さ</span><span begin="4:59.748" end="5:00.114">れ</span><span begin="5:00.114" end="5:00.765">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们烦恼也给予我们治愈</span></p><p begin="5:01.001" end="5:04.422" itunes:key="L59" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">強</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:01.001" end="5:01.272">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:01.272" end="5:01.564">よ</span></span></span><span begin="5:01.564" end="5:01.836">が</span><span begin="5:01.836" end="5:02.084">れ</span><span begin="5:02.084" end="5:02.375">る</span><span begin="5:02.577" end="5:02.881">こ</span><span begin="5:02.881" end="5:03.020">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">強</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:03.020" end="5:03.564">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:03.564" end="5:03.750">よ</span></span></span><span begin="5:03.750" end="5:04.137">さ</span><span begin="5:04.137" end="5:04.422">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份逞强的力量</span></p><p begin="5:04.616" end="5:08.834" itunes:key="L60" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">割</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:04.616" end="5:04.880">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:04.880" end="5:05.100">り</span></span></span><span begin="5:05.100" end="5:05.376">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:05.376" end="5:05.615">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:05.615" end="5:05.833">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">事</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:05.833" end="5:06.179">じ</span></span></span><span begin="5:06.179" end="5:06.628">み</span><span begin="5:06.628" end="5:06.924">た</span><span begin="5:06.924" end="5:07.274">い</span><span begin="5:07.274" end="5:08.834">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">意外的不可或缺</span></p><p begin="5:09.180" end="5:12.531" itunes:key="L61" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">不</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:09.180" end="5:09.274">ぶ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">細</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:09.274" end="5:09.698">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:09.698" end="5:09.931">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">工</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:09.931" end="5:10.212">く</span></span></span><span begin="5:10.212" end="5:10.481">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">心</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:10.692" end="5:10.939">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:10.939" end="5:11.251">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:11.251" end="5:11.557">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="5:11.648" end="5:11.960">ひ</span><span begin="5:11.960" end="5:12.204">と</span><span begin="5:12.204" end="5:12.531">つ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天也带着一颗笨拙打磨的心</span></p><p begin="5:12.738" end="5:21.202" itunes:key="L62" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:12.738" end="5:12.955">に</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:12.955" end="5:13.213">ち</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">常</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:13.213" end="5:13.767">じょう</span></span></span><span begin="5:13.767" end="5:14.004">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:14.004" end="5:14.365">きょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:14.365" end="5:14.526">う</span></span></span><span begin="5:14.526" end="5:14.771">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">生</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:14.771" end="5:15.008">い</span></span></span><span begin="5:15.008" end="5:15.428">き</span><span begin="5:15.428" end="5:21.202">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">度过同样的日常</span></p></div></body></tt>